<title>USA: Personnel Group hires James Hunt as CFO.</title>
<headline>Personnel Group hires James Hunt as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personnel Group of America Inc said it hired James Hunt as chief financial officer to replace Michael Bernard, who recently resigned.</p>
<p>The company said Hunt will assume his duties on January 2.</p>
<p>Hunt was most recently a partner at Arthur Anderson LLP, where he began his career in 1979, the company said.</p>
